D4 corpus — license fence
==========================

The files in this directory (USER*.data, cohort_selection.txt) are
derived from the McGill-NLP/WebLINX dataset (Lù, Kasner, Reddy 2024):

  https://huggingface.co/datasets/McGill-NLP/WebLINX
  arXiv:2402.05930

WebLINX is distributed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

By the ShareAlike clause of CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, any derivative of the
WebLINX dataset must be distributed under the same license. Therefore
the USER*.data files and cohort_selection.txt in this directory are
distributed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, not the MIT license that covers the
rest of cdt-prediction-bench.

Full license text:
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

Required attribution (per CC BY 4.0 clause inherited):
  Lù, Xing Han; Kasner, Zdeněk; Reddy, Siva (2024).
  WebLINX: Real-World Website Navigation with Multi-Turn Dialogue.
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/McGill-NLP/WebLINX

Use restrictions (per NC clause):
  Commercial use of these derived files is NOT permitted under
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. For commercial licensing of WebLINX, contact the
  original dataset authors at McGill-NLP.

Reproducibility / re-derivation:
  The derivation procedure is in scripts/explore_d4_weblinx.py and
  scripts/build_d4_weblinx.py (both under MIT — license fence applies
  to the OUTPUT files, not the builder code). Cohort selection rule
  is top-12 demonstrations by event count; see cohort_selection.txt
  for the deterministic mapping USER<k> -> demo_id -> event_count.
